== stdout (566 bytes)
Remove a companion opt-in from one or more brains.

Runs an interactive picker listing currently-enabled companions when no NAME is given. The global companion copy under ~/.kluris/companions is kept for cheap reuse.

Usage: kluris companion remove [OPTIONS] [specmint-core|specmint-tdd|specmint-core-html|specmint-tdd-html]

Arguments:
  [specmint-core|specmint-tdd|specmint-core-html|specmint-tdd-html]
          

Options:
      --brain <BRAIN>
          Brain name or 'all'

      --json
          JSON output

      --help
          Show this message and exit.
